        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Rianra pui ram hei patlou na.",
            "Kao Jerusalem kai gai khou,",
            "Tabui nung rui tang nina cho?",
            "Ting saeng gaipui ram khou tei.",
            "",
            "He! ning taan mak ge",
            "Tam dat makpui ram tei",
            "Ringh mei dui luang e,",
            "Kanlou mei guai rui zauna",
            "Ting saeng gaimei hou e",
            "",
            "2. Lauziunaa rui bampui ram tei,",
            "Tingmik thui ai ningtan makge,",
            "He! bumang than mei sam guang o,",
            "Nang ramgai khou jailou o.",
            "",
            "3. Hei khou tei Poubaomei bam e,",
            "Kalun neihmik kum ma ti e,",
            "Ata ti e hei tei ruina,",
            "Tingsaeng na ringdiu khang rui ."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
